12px; }.card-footer > span { font-size:12px;color:#9ba4b1; }.card-footer .el-button { gap:8px; }
@media(max-width:800px){.page-header { flex-wrap:wrap; }.course-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.course-stats { gap:10px; }.course-stats > div { padding:15px; }}

.search-bar { display:flex;gap:12px;max-width:680px;margin-bottom:24px; }.search-result,.application-status { background:white;padding:24px;border:1px solid #edf1f6;border-radius:18px;margin-bottom:24px; }.search-result,.application-head,.list-title { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px; }.search-result h3,.application-head h3,.list-title h3 { margin:0;font-size:18px; }.application-head { margin-bottom:14px; }.close-applications { border:0;background:#f6f8fb;border-radius:50%;width:30px;height:30px;cursor:pointer;color:#8792a2; }.close-applications:hover { color:#f04452;background:#fff0f2; }.application-row { display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #f0f3f7;padding:13px 0; }.list-title { margin:24px 0 16px; }.score-row { margin:22px 0 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:13px 16px;background:#f2faff;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:#6f7f91; }.score-row strong { font-size:23px;color:#14a1d2; }.student-actions { display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap; }.student-actions .el-button { margin:0;gap:6px; }
</style>
